        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>面试开口素材积累 DAY 13 - 互联网—银发知播</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #f07a1f 0%, #e8611a 40%, #d94d16 100%);\n    padding: 18px 16px 26px 16px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  /* Header */\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 6px 4px 14px 4px;\n  }\n  .header-title {\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    padding-left: 10px;\n  }\n  .day-badge {\n    width: 88px;\n    height: 82px;\n    border: 3px solid #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin-right: 14px;\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Bradley Hand\", cursive;\n  }\n  .day-badge .d-word {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .day-badge .d-num {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  /* Card */\n  .card {\n    background: #fdf6ef;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 18px 20px 26px 20px;\n  }\n  .subtitle-bar {\n    background: #e0561a;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 12px 0 14px 0;\n    margin: 4px 0 22px 0;\n  }\n  .subtitle-bar span {\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .section-head {\n    color: #d0451a;\n    font-family: \"Heiti SC\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 4px;\n  }\n  p.body {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.95;\n    color: #3a3a3a;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .num-circle {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 2px solid #d6338c;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: #d6338c;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin-right: 2px;\n  }\n  .hl-pink { background: #f7b6dd; }\n  .hl-orange { background: #ffd9a0; }\n  .u-blue {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #3b6fd4;\n  }\n  .u-purple {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #7a4fc0;\n  }\n  .pink-text { color: #d6338c; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"header-title\">面试开口素材积累</div>\n    <div class=\"day-badge\">\n      <span class=\"d-word\">DAY</span>\n      <span class=\"d-num\">13</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"subtitle-bar\"><span>互联网—银发知播</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-head\">三、对策</div>\n\n    <p class=\"body\">\n      <span class=\"num-circle\">1</span><span class=\"hl-pink pink-text\">积极帮助，搭建平台</span>。一方面，我们需重视“银发”群体，给予更多的关注和帮助，使更多的<span class=\"u-blue\">“银发族”能够克服电子围墙</span>，从而能够更好地继续发挥自己的专业技能和经验；另一方面，我们也需要注重创造更多的社会机会和平台，<span class=\"hl-orange u-blue\">期待更多有知识、有文化、有智慧的老人加入“银发知播”队伍</span>，成为传播科学知识和科技发展的“自发青年”，在更多领域生动演绎“时光不老”的传说。\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"body\">\n      <span class=\"num-circle\">2</span><span class=\"hl-pink pink-text\">疏堵结合，算法推荐</span>。规范短视频平台，在创新监管手段、严惩违法违规行为之外，<span class=\"hl-orange u-blue\">还要挖掘、创作更多更好的优质内容，形成“良币驱逐劣币”</span>的效应。平台要切实履行主体责任，在流量引导、算法推荐上向优质“知播”倾斜，营造健康理性的网络视频生态，为优质短视频作品的传播营造良好环境，多一些类似<span class=\"u-purple\">“银发知播”这样有温度、有深度的优质内容推送</span>。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
